character interacting naturally with the environment.

## 색 — 여기서부터는 메인이 아니라 위에 얹는 것

pale cool ivory skin,
desaturated skin,
subtle gray undertones,
muted cool color palette,
low chroma,
restrained saturation,

strong separation between light and shadow,
clear graphic values,
